<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113696" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειροτον-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>extension of the hand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Is.</u>
				58.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>voting by show of hands,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.49
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειροτονίαν μνηστεύειν</span> to
			court or seek <i>election,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				8.15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. τοῦ δήμον</span>
			<i>election</i> by the people, <i><span class="en">
				Din.
				1.114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>S.Pelekides</u>
				76
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thessalonica</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally, <i>election, appointment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.93
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>a vote,</i> in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				659b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.3
			</span></i>; collectively, <i>votes,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷς ἂν ἡ πλείστη χ. γίγνηται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					755d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				756b
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
